  dense                    55.3us   40.00 MiB/stack     759 GB/s
  lowrank_fused_r128       57.3us   10.00 MiB/stack     183 GB/s   -3.70% vs dense
  grouped_g4               44.0us   10.00 MiB/stack     238 GB/s  +20.37% vs dense

