  lowrank_fused_r128       57.3us   10.00 MiB/stack     183 GB/s  +39.13% vs dense
  grouped_g4               44.8us   10.00 MiB/stack     234 GB/s  +52.50% vs dense

--- 24 replica(s): dense working set 960 MiB (PAST L2) ---
  dense                    94.9us   40.00 MiB/stack     442 GB/s
  lowrank_fused_r128       66.6us   10.00 MiB/stack     158 GB/s  +29.90% vs dense
