=== VERDICT ===
  dense working set     40 MiB -> lowrank_fused_r128  -3.70% vs dense
  dense working set    160 MiB -> lowrank_fused_r128 +39.13% vs dense
  dense working set    960 MiB -> lowrank_fused_r128 +29.90% vs dense

  CLAIM SUPPORTED: low-rank loses in-cache and WINS past L2. The original
